{"name": "Snack Station Co-op Simulator", "description": "<div class=\"game_area_description\" id=\"game_area_description\">\n<h2>About This Game</h2>\n<h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>ALIENS ARE HUNGRY</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/ec4c94ed509ee8a69e9fd07253e917a0.poster.avif?t=1787517770\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/ec4c94ed509ee8a69e9fd07253e917a0.webm?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/ec4c94ed509ee8a69e9fd07253e917a0.mp4?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Open a cozy little space diner with your friends way out on the edge of the galaxy. Cook up food, serve your alien customers, and make sure nobody leaves hungry!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>THE WHOLE PRODUCTION LINE</strong><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/b33d017351800c93b5f38d8b7da1c734.poster.avif?t=1787517770\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/b33d017351800c93b5f38d8b7da1c734.webm?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/b33d017351800c93b5f38d8b7da1c734.mp4?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Travel to all sorts of planets in search of ingredients for your dishes. Catch cosmic creatures, gather bizarre plants, grow your own crops on the farm, and toss it all into the sci-fi blender to stock the shelves for your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>NUGGETS OR MERCY?</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/be08ded90a6d685a6d88ae79b10907fd.poster.avif?t=1787517770\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/be08ded90a6d685a6d88ae79b10907fd.webm?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/be08ded90a6d685a6d88ae79b10907fd.mp4?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">That adorable little dragon could become the key ingredient in a pricey dish. Or a beloved pet for your customers to fawn over. You decide what to feed them: meat from rare creatures or fruit from cosmic plants. And hey, nothing's stopping you from doing both.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>DECK OUT YOUR DINER</strong></h2><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video autoplay=\"\" class=\"bb_img\" height=\"374\" loop=\"\" muted=\"\" playsinline=\"\" poster=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/383e8926d594d737c49dbfeffb21ccf9.poster.avif?t=1787517770\" width=\"1170\"><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/383e8926d594d737c49dbfeffb21ccf9.webm?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"/><source src=\"https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/extras/383e8926d594d737c49dbfeffb21ccf9.mp4?t=1787517770\" type=\"video/mp4\"/></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Line up the shelves, fill them with snacks, decorate the dining area, and watch your empty station slowly grow into the most stylish cafe in the galaxy.</p> </div>", "short_desc": "A co-op snack bar sim on the edge of the galaxy. Land on weird planets, hunt critters, gather fruit and cook it all up for your oddball customers. So what's on the menu? Meaty dishes from adorable space creatures, or a fully vegan spread? Your call.", "header_image": "https://shared.fastly.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/5035550/c9926faacc2c32f784631b3eab01574ff835339e/header.jpg?t=1787517770", "screenshots": [], "tags": ["Shop Keeper", "Space", "Life Sim", "3D", "Simulation", "Team-Based"], "developers": "Imago Games O\u00dc", "publishers": "Imago Games O\u00dc", "release_date": "Coming soon", "price": "Coming Soon", "appid": "5035550", "review_type": "Informational", "curator_desc": "23 August 2026 - Request Access", "yt_link": "https://youtu.be/s4BaAX4Zvng", "first_seen": 1787436000.0, "review_rank": 69}